    {
      "key": "te9ff0898bbb55898",
      "english": "A demo account lets you learn the platform and practice your rules without risking real capital. Demo results can still differ from live trading. Execution, liquidity and emotions all play a part.",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/forex-trading-strategy-market-conditions"
      ],
      "translation": "模拟账户让您学习平台并练习交易规则，而无需承担真实资金损失的风险。模拟结果仍可能与实盘交易不同，成交执行、流动性和情绪都会产生影响。"
    },
