    {
      "key": "tb6acb6ba80437a58",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account balance is the settled value of a trading account excluding current open-position profit or loss. Account equity adjusts that balance in real time for floating P/L. Floating P/L is the unrealized result of open trades, which is why Balance and Equity can show different figures at the same moment.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">账户余额是交易账户已结算的价值，不包括当前未平仓头寸的损益。账户净值是在余额基础上实时计入浮动盈亏后的数值。浮动盈亏是未平仓交易尚未实现的结果，因此余额和净值可能在同一时刻显示不同的数字。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t03b769993d56b901",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Withdrawals</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">提款</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t67f67fda5165997a",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Profit from closed trades</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平仓交易的利润</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t8d09d97bee69f739",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Losses from closed trades</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平仓交易造成的损失</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tb767e7d41eee22ac",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Balance is therefore useful for understanding settled account value, but it does not provide the complete real-time picture when positions remain open.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">因此，余额对于了解结算账户价值很有用，但它无法提供未平仓头寸的完整实时情况。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t7330da727b69b6d6",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Account Equity?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是账户净值？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t9891396dc64d31d5",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account equity</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> is the current value of a trading account after the net floating profit or loss from open positions is included.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">账户净值</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">是指交易账户在计入未平仓净浮动盈亏后的当前价值。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tece23dd497c2fc0c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">In brokerage-account terminology, this is the practical definition of equity for a forex or CFD trading account: it combines the settled Balance with the current unrealized result of open positions.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在经纪账户术语中，这是外汇或差价合约交易账户权益的实际定义：它将结算余额与未平仓头寸的当前未实现结果相结合。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t2b64436cafafa594",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Equity = Balance + Net Floating P/L</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">净值 = 余额 + 净浮动盈亏</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t77deac8fdf69ad31",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The net floating P/L may be positive or negative.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">净浮动盈亏可能为正或为负。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "td185cb4858823f00",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Net floating P/L = +$300</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">净浮动盈亏 = +300 美元</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "ta1afb95e18b77b46",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Net floating P/L = -$300</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">净浮动盈亏 = -$300</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tfc969644848d713c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What Is Floating Profit and Loss?</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">什么是浮动盈亏？</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t1dd17a8ad33ba16c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Floating P/L</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\"> is the unrealized profit or loss associated with positions that are still open.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">浮动盈亏</span><span data-i18n-slot=\"1\">是与未平仓头寸相关的未实现利润或损失。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t6141cc3eeb5ff082",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">While the position remains open, the result is unrealized.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">当仓位保持未平仓状态时，结果尚未实现。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t837a8c7d2404da29",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">When the trade closes:</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">交易结束时：</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc3307dfb041aeb79",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">The closed position stops contributing floating P/L to Equity.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">平仓头寸停止为净值贡献浮动盈亏。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tedf19867c06ddabb",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">This is why Balance can stay exactly the same for some time while Equity moves continuously.</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">这就是为什么余额可以在一段时间内保持完全相同，而净值却不断变化。</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tc2c95a6dd071da21",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">What It Measures</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "CMS:blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading",
        "SSR:/blogs/how-economic-events-move-the-market-nfp-cpi-fed"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">衡量什么</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4a96d7c3503674bd",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Stays Fixed When...</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">在...时保持固定</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t4d1139b404a76d6c",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Settled account value</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">已结算账户价值</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "tea0369892db87861",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">A position closes, a deposit or withdrawal posts, or another completed balance adjustment occurs</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">头寸平仓、存款或取款过账或其他已完成的余额调整发生</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t3c2c4bdc7e9d71ca",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Open positions simply move in price</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "SSR:/blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading"
      ],
      "translation": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">未平仓头寸只是价格变动</span>"
    },
    {
      "key": "t98bb8eb33604ff39",
      "english": "<span data-i18n-slot=\"0\">Account Equity</span>",
      "kind": "html",
      "sources": [
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-account-equity-in-trading#content",
        "CMS:blogs/what-is-drawdown-in-trading#content",
